Package: micronicheR
Type: Package
Title: Microclimate-Based Physiological Niche Modeling
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
      given = "Jhonatan Rafael",
      family = "Zárate-Salazar",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "rzaratesalazar@gmail.com"
    )
Description: Tools for microclimate-based physiological niche modeling
    using environmental rasters, species traits, and 'NicheMapR'.
    The package provides an extensible framework for integrating
    microclimate simulations with mechanistic niche models,
    currently supporting endotherm applications and designed for
    future extension to ectotherm modeling.
